      <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>Flashlight Shortcut</string>
        <key>footerText</key>
        <string>These shortcuts let you toggle the flashlight. Some won't work depending on device type and iOS version

For triple click to work, you have to have an accessibility shortcut set, which this tweak will override

"Set Max Brightness" will set the highest flashlight level when you use the shortcut. Otherwise, the last set level will be used</string>
      </dict>
      <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSLinkListCell</string>
        <key>detail</key>
        <string>PSListItemsController</string>
        <key>key</key>
        <string>kFlashlightShortcut</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>Flashlight Shortcut</string>
        <key>validTitles</key>
        <array>
          <string>Disabled</string>
          <string>Volume Up + Down</string>
          <string>Lock Button Double Click</string>
          <string>Lock Button Triple Click</string>
          <string>Lock Button Hold</string>
          <string>Home Button Double Click</string>
          <string>Home Button Triple Click</string>
          <string>Home Button Hold</string>
          <string>Ringer</string>
          <string>Ringer Inverted</string>
        </array>
        <key>validValues</key>
        <array>
          <string>disabled</string>
          <string>volume</string>
          <string>doubleLock</string>
          <string>tripleLock</string>
          <string>holdLock</string>
          <string>doubleHome</string>
          <string>tripleHome</string>
          <string>holdHome</string>
          <string>ringer</string>
          <string>ringerInverted</string>
